  <regions type="content">
    <region left="20" top="64" width="1560" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="15" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;">Gate Driver Calculation  -  one output pin, R.g_on and (D.off + R.g_off), 0 V off</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="110" width="1560" height="51" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">Network: driver OUT - R.g_on - gate, and D.off in series with R.g_off across R.g_on, cathode toward OUT. Turn-on: R.g_on alone. Turn-off: R.g_on in parallel with R.g_off + V.F. Yellow cells are the inputs. Section 2 holds the driver (written for STGAP3SXS):</p>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">its numbers are PLACEHOLDERS - the STGAP3SXS datasheet was not available when the sheet was built - replace every one of them from the datasheet.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="185" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">1  Switch and gate network</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="220" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-ON gate resistor R.g_on (series, both edges):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="220" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.g_on</e>
        <e type="operand">15</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="263" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-OFF gate resistor R.g_off (in series with D.off):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="263" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.g_off</e>
        <e type="operand">7.5</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="306" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-off diode forward voltage V.F at the peak current:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="306" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.F</e>
        <e type="operand">0.7</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="349" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">read at the turn-off peak current computed in section 3, not at 10 mA.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="380" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-off diode surge current rating I.FSM (short pulse):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="380" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.FSM_D</e>
        <e type="operand">2</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="423" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-off diode average forward current rating:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="423" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.F_D</e>
        <e type="operand">0.15</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="466" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switch internal gate resistance (datasheet R.G):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="466" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.g_int</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="509" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switch input capacitance C.iss:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="509" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">C.iss</e>
        <e type="operand">4307</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">pF</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="552" width="470" height="47" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switch total gate charge Q.g at V.H [10^-9 A s]:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="552" width="1080" height="47" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">Q.g</e>
        <e type="operand">210</e>
        <e type="operand">10</e>
        <e type="operand">9</e>
        <e type="operator" args="1">-</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">s</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="607" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">read from the gate charge curve at the drive voltage V.H.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="638" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switches driven per channel (paralleled):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="638" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">n.par</e>
        <e type="operand">1</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="681" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">Example switch values are those of the uploaded sheet (WG75N65MFW1, 18 V, 85 kHz); replace them with the switch used.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="728" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">2  Switching and gate driver (STGAP3SXS - placeholders, replace from its datasheet)</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="763" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switching frequency:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="763" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">f.sw</e>
        <e type="operand">85</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">kHz</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="806" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-ON gate voltage V.H (positive supply):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="806" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.H</e>
        <e type="operand">18</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="849" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-OFF gate voltage V.L (0 V, unipolar):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="849" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.L</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="892" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] Driver output resistance, source:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="892" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.on_H</e>
        <e type="operand">1</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="935" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] Driver output resistance, sink:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="935" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.on_L</e>
        <e type="operand">1.5</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="978" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] Driver peak source current rating:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="978" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.src_max</e>
        <e type="operand">6</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1021" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">a distributor listing gives 6 A and 10 A without saying which is source and which is sink - confirm both from the datasheet.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1184" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] Driver peak sink current rating:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1184" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.snk_max</e>
        <e type="operand">6</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1227" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] Driver quiescent current, isolated side, at V.H:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1227" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.Q</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">mA</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1270" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] Thermal resistance junction-ambient [C/W]:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1270" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.th_JA</e>
        <e type="operand">120</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1313" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">120 is the first version&#x27;s value, not the SO-16W figure of the STGAP3SXS.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1344" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] Maximum junction temperature [C]:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1344" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">T.j_max</e>
        <e type="operand">125</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1403" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">3  Peak currents</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1438" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Gate swing:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1438" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="1">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.sw</e>
        <e type="operand">V.H</e>
        <e type="operand">V.L</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">18.0</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1481" width="470" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Turn-on path resistance, R.on_H + R.g_on + R.g_int / n.par:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1481" width="1080" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="3">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.path_on</e>
        <e type="operand">R.on_H</e>
        <e type="operand">R.g_on</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
        <e type="operand">R.g_int</e>
        <e type="operand">n.par</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
